 R10 adds BLUE-key reordering of the dashboard menu. UP/DOWN moves the
 selected entry, OK or BLUE saves its position, and EXIT cancels the move.
 The order is stored in native Enigma2 settings and shared across sources.
 R11 tolerates delayed 5002 seek-position updates without issuing a duplicate
 relative seek or falsely reporting that the stream cannot be seeked.
 Explicit seek-call failures retain the existing fallback and error handling.
