 R58 fixes download screen geometry on wide displays and uses safe screen
 dimensions if the Enigma2 desktop size is temporarily unavailable.
 R59 selects H.264 MP4 video and AAC audio for separate YouTube streams,
 falling back to a combined stream or HLS when no suitable audio is present.
 Receiver and web settings expose quality, compatible/DASH playback, audio
 preference and search language, localized in all 43 receiver catalogs.
